WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.400
Your chats live in Claude, ChatGPT,

00:03.400 --> 00:06.400
Claude Code, Codex and Antigravity.

00:06.400 --> 00:09.400
And every AI forgets the others.

00:09.400 --> 00:10.800
Meet Carryover.

00:10.800 --> 00:13.300
Carryover finds the AI apps on your computer

00:13.300 --> 00:17.300
and brings all your chats into one private memory graph.

00:17.300 --> 00:20.800
See them by app, topic, project or time.

00:20.800 --> 00:24.400
Search everything, and slide back to any day.

00:24.400 --> 00:27.700
Claude Code, Codex and Antigravity sync on their own,

00:27.700 --> 00:31.700
and Claude and ChatGPT come in from their official exports.

00:31.700 --> 00:33.200
Hit a usage limit?

00:33.200 --> 00:35.400
Drag the chat onto another app.

00:35.400 --> 00:37.500
Carryover writes a handoff summary,

00:37.500 --> 00:41.300
quick or complete, so you pick up exactly where you left off.

00:41.300 --> 00:45.300
Ask several models at once and watch the answers side by side.

00:45.300 --> 00:48.600
A fair judge scores them without knowing who wrote them,

00:48.600 --> 00:51.700
and your own leaderboard shows which AI wins at what.

00:51.700 --> 00:53.800
Select any line to have it explained,

00:53.800 --> 00:56.400
and save your best prompts to reuse.

00:56.400 --> 01:00.900
Carryover also learns short facts about how you work, from your own messages.

01:00.900 --> 01:05.200
You approve each one in a weekly review, fix conflicts between apps,

01:05.200 --> 01:09.500
and share your memory with Claude Code, Codex, or any MCP app.

01:09.500 --> 01:12.700
A local filter removes secrets before anything is sent.

01:12.700 --> 01:16.000
Backups are encrypted, and it works with free local models.

01:16.000 --> 01:19.000
No account. No server. No API keys.

01:19.000 --> 01:22.000
Carryover. Free for Windows and Mac.
